      ":question/worked-solution": "The graph breaks at $x=-2$ and $x=1$ and $x=3.5$, meaning that we can't draw the plot without taking our pencil off of the paper when passing through these points.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $x=-2$ and $x=1$ and $x=3.5$.",
